          "jcr:created": "Tue May 14 2019 22:27:18 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">Balance ACS (BACS)</span></span></p>\n<p>Balance ACS is a comprehensive platform that applies three-dimensional solutions across the entire clinical care continuum to help drive quality outcomes for spine patients. It provides tools – from surgical preauthorization and preoperative planning to 3D anatomical modeling and postoperative reporting – to support the perioperative process.</p>\n",
